
==============================================================================
E1 - drop the durability ordering entirely (REG-002 E1)
==============================================================================
  WT-083 drew delta SORTED DESCENDING: durability rises up the ladder, the
  inference from the standards' scheduling behaviour. Here delta is drawn i.i.d.
  and UNORDERED over the same support. phi still falls up the ladder -- that is
  the design and it is not in question.

                                        ORDERED (WT-083)       UNORDERED
  recovers the registered ordering                  1.9%           11.5%
  exactly reverses it                              23.8%            1.1%
  non-monotone                                     74.2%           87.4%
  mean Kendall tau                                -0.414          +0.318
     sd                                            0.515           0.450
     se of the mean                               0.0081          0.0071
  share of ladders with tau <= 0                   85.4%           33.9%

  REG-002 E1 falsifier was stated on |mean tau| and is DEFECTIVE -- see the
  erratum in REG-002. An absolute value cannot tell a vanished effect from a
  reversed one, and this is the case that separates them.
  signed mean tau, unordered: +0.318  (se 0.0071) -- POSITIVE.
  -> the inversion is not weakened by dropping the durability ordering. It is
     ABSENT. Without that ordering the design's own term is the only systematic
     force left and the ranking runs, on average, the way it was designed to.
  SEVERE     dropping the durability ordering moves mean tau materially toward zero
  Witness is the ordered draw asked the same question of itself, which cannot
  be materially closer to zero than it is.
  SEVERE     the reversal RATE is a property of the assumed ordering, not of the confound alone

  WITNESS WORLD -- delta held COMMON across the four tiers: recovery 100.0%
  SEVERE     delta DISPERSION alone -- with no ordering imposed at all -- destroys the design's recovery of its own ordering
  Witness is the common-delta world asked to clear its own bar, which it cannot.
  So the confound and the ordering do DIFFERENT damage: dispersion destroys the
  ranking (98.1% -> 88.5% of worlds non-recovering), and the ordering is what
  turns the wreckage into a REVERSAL (23.8% against 1.1%).

